; iter-122: pushed top wall y from 96 → 128 to carve out a dedicated
; non-gameplay HUD zone at the top of the screen. The shape is the same
; 1280×40 horizontal rect; its center y just moves down by 32. Verified
; against every room.tres — every authored spawn / torch / pillar /
; hazard / lore-stone y is ≥130, so this new floor doesn't strand any
; data. PLAY_AREA_MIN.y in main.gd matches; iter-115 chrome auto-
; redraws against the new top.
[node name="WallTop" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Walls"]
position = Vector2(640, 128)
shape = SubResource("wall_h")

[node name="WallBottom" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Walls"]
position = Vector2(640, 672)
shape = SubResource("wall_h")

; Torches are NO LONGER instanced here — main.gd spawns them from
