; Iter 17 — boss HP bar. Hidden by default; main.gd makes it visible
; when an EnemyType with is_boss=true spawns and binds the bar value
; to the live enemy's hp each frame. Container is a VBoxContainer
; centered horizontally just below the RoomLabel so it doesn't fight
; with the corner HUD.
; iter-122: shifted below the HUD shelf (was offset_top=50, which
; collided with the new room title at y=20..58 + relic slot at
; y=70..116). Boss bar now floats over the room interior at y=140..200,
; just below the HUD trim line so it reads as combat info coming
; FROM the dungeon, not from the HUD shelf above.
